# Rename to technology-timeline.yaml and place in X:\00_INBOX when inputs exist.
name: technology-timeline-nlp
stations:
  - metadata-extractor
  - claim-extraction
  - timeline-verifier
  - graph-linker
inputs:
  - technology-timelines\*
prompt: |
  Use the complete governing prompt at:
  X:\03_WORKFLOWS\TechnologyTimelineNLP\PROMPTS\MASTER_TIMELINE_REFINERY.md

  Extract atomic dated events first. Preserve source spans, conflicting dates,
  development stages, contributor disputes, and candidate enablement edges. Do
  not silently merge similar inventions. All outputs remain CANDIDATE and
  unresolved fields remain UNKNOWN.
vectorize: inspect
run: stage
timeout: 7200
chain: true
notes: "Stage first. Review outputs before final synthesis or routing."
